---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/60">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 lg:px-8">
		<div>
			<h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-100">Fishing Project</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
				Soluzioni moderne per esperienze digitali nel mondo della pesca e del turismo.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div>
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-100">Link utili</h3>
			<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
				<li><a href="/" class="transition hover:text-sky-400">Home</a></li>
				<li><a href="#services" class="transition hover:text-sky-400">Servizi</a></li>
				<li><a href="#contact" class="transition hover:text-sky-400">Contatti</a></li>
			</ul>
		</div>

		<div id="contact">
			<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-100">Contatti</h3>
			<ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-400">
				<li>Email: info@fishingproject.it</li>
				<li>Telefono: +39 0123 456789</li>
				<li>Indirizzo: Via del Porto 10, Napoli</li>
			</ul>
			<div class="mt-4 flex gap-4">
				<a 
					href="https://wa.me/390000000000" 
					target="_blank" 
					rel="noreferrer" 
					class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/50 text-slate-400 transition hover:border-green-500/50 hover:bg-green-500/10 hover:text-green-400"
					aria-label="WhatsApp"
				>
					<i class="fab fa-whatsapp text-lg"></i>
				</a>
				<a 
					href="https://instagram.com/your-profile" 
					target="_blank" 
					rel="noreferrer" 
					class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/50 text-slate-400 transition hover:border-pink-500/50 hover:bg-pink-500/10 hover:text-pink-400"
					aria-label="Instagram"
				>
					<i class="fab fa-instagram text-lg"></i>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="border-t border-slate-800 py-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
		© {year} Fishing Project. Tutti i diritti riservati.
	</div>
</footer>
